  "details": "Unity 2022 no longer reserves layers 3, 6, and 7 for itself. Previously, Unity 2019 did not allow them to be used.\n\nHowever, the VRChat SDK does not allow worlds to be uploaded if they use layers 3, 6, or 7.\n\nI'm not sure if there's a reason for this restriction, so maybe it should be removed.",
